# The image keeps the 255 most frequent records of functions in a table of their own; a function with another record is marked, and the run time looks its record up by the function's number: here for the frames of an error's stack.
# THE LIE, testing=RecordsOfFunctionsAreListedUnderOtherNumbers: all records but the most frequent one are listed by function, each under the number behind its own.
# In every build the row found is asked to be there and to bear the number asked for, or the process ends.
# AS-USERS-BUILD: the run time asks the row in every build.
# RUN(RIGHT): run-in-shell mechanisms=all
# RIGHT: has frames string
# RIGHT-NEXT: exited with 0
# RUN(HELD): run-in-shell mechanisms=all testing=RecordsOfFunctionsAreListedUnderOtherNumbers
# HELD: crashed with SIGABRT
